1. Corrections
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Once again, I have a few corrections to make to a previously posted section 
of the Spoilers.  It seems that whenever I make an assumption that "surely 
that must not have changed" it (of course) has changed.  Thus it was with 
many of the level titles for the various character classes.  I had also 
forgotten to take into account variations of the titles based on the sex of 
the character.  In any case, the following charts supersede the various 
