2. WCST Releases
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Once again, just to repeat myself:  Revision 8.00 is not yet finished, nor is 
the commercial version of Revision 8.00 yet available.  I'm working on it, 
and you're seeing bits and pieces of it as they come out!

The following is a list of the various bits and pieces that have been 
released over the past several months, so that you can figure out if you've 
got everything that's been released or not.  Once again - PLEASE DO NOT ASK 
ME TO SEND YOU STUFF THAT YOU MISSED.  I just don't have the time to honor 
all the requests that I get like that.

By the way...  Is anybody archiving these on an FTP site?  If so, please send 
me mail about where they are (send this to the rec.games.hack FAQ compiler, 
too).  If not, any suggestions?

